# a shared number with a view (docs/VIEWS.md): its page draws it between a − and a + button
of: record
form: <<END
name: text 1..64
END
head: {name}
voice: a number on a wall that anyone may nudge; it remembers who nudged it last
about: a number anyone raises or lowers, one step a turn, drawn live on its page
body: counter
